## Local Configuration Example for OSP KUE Reader
## Copy this file to `local.properties` and customize as needed.

## Location of the Android SDK
sdk.dir=/Users/YOUR_USERNAME/Library/Android/sdk

## (Optional) Proprietary IronSource Ad Key
# IRONSOURCE_APP_KEY=your_ironsource_app_key_here

## (Optional) Release Signing Configuration
# RELEASE_STORE_FILE=path/to/your/release-keystore.jks
# RELEASE_STORE_PASSWORD=your_keystore_password
# RELEASE_KEY_ALIAS=your_key_alias
# RELEASE_KEY_PASSWORD=your_key_password
